# Security headers for hosts that read this file (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages).
# The page itself carries the main Content Security Policy in a <meta> tag (Layout.astro);
# these are the protections a <meta> tag can't set. Allow the microphone (microphone=(self))
# when voice input ships.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
